## Field Reports

Contributors who did not submit code, but whose diagnostic work located a
defect precisely enough to fix it.

Pencreus — https://github.com/Pencreus
  - v2.7.1 (issue #19): connectedMiners and poolEffort both reporting 0 for a coin served
    only through the Multi coin smart port, while that coin was the active
    rotation slot and genuinely accepting shares. The report carried per-coin
    API payloads from either side of a TIME-mode rotation switch, an
    accepted-shares delta across two calls proving submission was live, and a
    ruled-out list that eliminated frontend, caching and stale-session causes
    before triage started. It also isolated the one structural difference
    between an affected and an unaffected coin, which is what made the real
    variable findable. (See v2.7.1 provenance note below for where that
    hypothesis landed.)
  - Same user-visible symptom as issue #6 (kamakhu, v2.5.x), which was fixed by
    introducing MultiPortSessionProvider. That mechanism was correct; v2.7.1
    fixes a path where it was never attached. Two defects, one symptom.

W3dgraf — https://github.com/W3dgraf
  - v3.0.2 (issue #20): BraiinsOS 26.09.1-plus on an Antminer S19K Pro could not
    be read. The report separated two independent defects and isolated each one:
    the HTTP 401 on `Authorization: Bearer <token>` against a 200 on the raw
    token, and the `/api/v1/pools/` list response that crashed the dictionary
    parser. It proposed the fix for both, including a fallback for the older
    dictionary format, and verified it on hardware: fetch_braiins() came back
    online with hashrate, power, temperatures, shares and pool URL filled in.
  - v3.0.2 (issue #21): native install on Debian 13 (Trixie) stopped because
    software-properties-common is not in the Trixie repositories. The report
    confirmed this with apt-cache, cited Debian bug #1110699, and showed the
    package is not needed on the Debian path: with an equivs dummy package in
    its place, the full installation completed without any change to install.sh.

